sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant App as Frontend app
    participant Gateway as API Gateway
    participant Auth as Auth service
    participant Store as Session/token store

    User->>App: Request sign-in
    App->>Gateway: Start authentication
    Gateway->>Auth: Forward request
    Auth->>Auth: Validate request and OTP flow
    Auth->>Store: Persist session/token state if applicable
    Auth-->>Gateway: Authentication result
    Gateway-->>App: Response
    App-->>User: Signed-in state

    Note over App,Store: Verify exact token, cookie, session and refresh behavior in code.
